      "message": "According to the comment of the function, the return value can be `[2,PORT_MAX_RFC_PORTS]`.\nThe `next_available_scn` initial value is `2`, and in this case `2` will be return.\n\nif you have `scn \u003d PORT_MAX_RFC_PORTS -1`, then at line 46 you increment it to be `scn \u003d PORT_MAX_RFC_PORTS`.\n\nSince `scn \u003d\u003d PORT_MAX_RFC_PORTS` you go into the if, reset scn to 2 and will never return `PORT_MAX_RFC_PORTS`.\n\n\nIn my opinion there is a mismatch between the code and the documentation.\n\nI expect one of the test that I have added to fail in this configuration.",
